{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-15","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：圆柱与圆锥与比例","englishTitle":"In equal cones and cylinders the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights; and those cones and cylinders in which the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights are equal.","book":12,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","contentId":"euclid-12-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cb7a8da67bb0c67ce3bfec079147901105191343430bbdc733585463dd57d5a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-15.statement","euclid-12-15.construction.1","euclid-12-15.proof.1","euclid-12-15.proof.2","euclid-12-15.proof.3","euclid-12-15.proof.4","euclid-12-15.proof.5","euclid-12-15.proof.6","euclid-12-15.proof.7","euclid-12-15.proof.8","euclid-12-15.proof.9","euclid-12-15.proof.10","euclid-12-15.proof.11","euclid-12-15.proof.12","euclid-12-15.proof.13","euclid-12-15.proof.14","euclid-12-15.proof.15","euclid-12-15.proof.16","euclid-12-15.conclusion","euclid-12-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"129c2bf5bc0f856a73b93037a6281d00b8adc9a23b0f10e8305762d90467f0db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal cones and cylinders the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights; and those cones and cylinders in which the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在等式锥体和圆柱体中,底边是对等的成比例至高度;底边是对等的成比例至高度的锥体和圆锥体是等式的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51aa8cd46c436b6ff592b088ecd9529c59d2b82f4fc667680d6c924cbe3b443b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be equal cones and cylinders of which the circles ABCD, EFGH are the bases; let AC, EG be the diameters of the bases, and KL, MN the axes, which are also the heights of the cones or cylinders; let the cylinders AO, EP be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"允许有等式锥体和圆锥体,其中圆圈ABCD,EFGH为底边;让AC,EG为底边直径,轴线KL,MN为锥体或圆锥体高度;让圆锥体AO,EP完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8edfdd5c5a1232ec16adb48488c40a1fe1d2e1b513ed0817e5fb3187d63de2a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that in the cylinders AO, EP the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：在圆柱 AO、EP 中，底面与高互成反比例；也就是说，底面 ABCD 与底面 EFGH 之比，等于高 MN 与高 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0844243068fd2ea66de82cf22d1426e4e1b6db87c7c5485c0dcf6ececc08575","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the height LK is either equal to the height MN or not equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"高度为LK, 等于高度为MN, 或不等于高度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e94ab7b309c722009f81b1ccd1531daf2646ef5fdb7791f866fd8160108838a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它平等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a199920ea8b039eda4bd2be76804637450c645187a910865f5b9bb12cc160c09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the cylinder AO is also equal to the cylinder EP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AO气瓶也等于EP气瓶。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd81d6ff3a9c86ddc65ac0ce9a96fcc6fd8fbbe0b81c6025012f54d67d1ab339","citations":["euclid-12-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But cones and cylinders which are of the same height are to one another as their bases; [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)] therefore the base ABCD is also equal to the base EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,高度与底边相同的锥体和圆柱体是彼此的;因此,底边 ABCD也等于底边 EFGH。 [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68f564429e36305daabec3e0e6658b0be59b7e9b5ef11b978c1da8ede9e7c255","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence also, reciprocally, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,对等比例底边 ABCD对底边 EFGH等于MN对KL"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0985fb416b6c533c86e26fcca5eb64994a0bb36c0950d683b126c536bf2402bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the height LK not be equal to MN, but let MN be greater; from the height MN let QN be cut off equal to KL, through the point Q let the cylinder EP be cut by the plane TUS parallel to the planes of the circles EFGH, RP, and let the cylinder ES be conceived erected from the circle EFGH as base and with height NQ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,让LK高度不等于MN高度,但让MN高度更大;从MN高度切除QN高度等于KL高度,到Q点,让EP气瓶被平面TUS圆圈的平面EFGH圆圈的平行切割,让ES圆圈从EFGH圆圈中竖起底边和NQ高度。（相关点与线段：RP）"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0fa803a98be4bbc094c0130458a139ccfc2ae4e041b3048e18e663290715146","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the cylinder AO is equal to the cylinder EP, therefore, as the cylinder AO is to the cylinder ES, so is the cylinder EP to the cylinder ES. [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AO气瓶等于EP气瓶,因此,AO气瓶与ES气瓶的比等于EP气瓶与ES气瓶的比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e1894bcb9d05b2a5d7cba5f9f91af27204b0e744eef36fda430de67a9b12e2a","citations":["euclid-12-11","euclid-12-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the cylinder AO is to the cylinder ES, so is the base ABCD to the base EFGH, for the cylinders AO, ES are of the same height; [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)] and, as the cylinder EP is to the cylinder ES, so is the height MN to the height QN, for the cylinder EP has been cut by a plane which is parallel to its opposite planes. [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AO气瓶与ES气瓶的比等于底边 ABCD气瓶与底边 EFGH气瓶的比,ES气瓶与ES气瓶的高度比相同;EP气瓶与ES气瓶的比等于MN气瓶与QN气瓶的高度比,EP气瓶的比为平面,这一比值与平面气瓶的对比值为平面。 [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)] [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1bc8f4cf712f044b5a44bee9edc468b424b66843bba4a74e93d5f8984c2abc8","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height QN. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,底边 ABCD对底边 EFGH的比也等于MN对QN的高度比 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efa38bc3394537e872f28dd940ed71afd41522b71e9fac5f410160b344835539","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the height QN is equal to the height KL; therefore, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但高度QN等于高度KL;因此,底边 ABCD与底边 EFGH的比等于高度MN与高度KL的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2943f517639db6d15f50d0ffa43dc6a8d51dab4a8c89154022ef644ca930a5f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the cylinders AO, EP the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在AO、EP气瓶中,底边气瓶的高度是成比例至成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08fc1f4c47dc4cb6c96e126645ba64db5e178e594f97c16b85c86ac101f6cf5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, in the cylinders AO, EP let the bases be reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so let the height MN be to the height KL; I say that the cylinder AO is equal to the cylinder EP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,在AO,EP气瓶中,底边气瓶对等为成比例,即底边ABCD对等为底边EFGH,所以,MN气瓶对等为KL;我说,AO气瓶等于EP气瓶。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"565b858736d49c7f728b9803e93b00b149649f1cb33423150e925e4580224970","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height KL, while the height KL is equal to the height QN, therefore, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the height MN to the height QN"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的构造,底边 ABCD对底边 EFGH的比等于MN对KL的高度,而KL的高度等于QN的高度,因此,底边 ABCD对底边 EFGH的比等于MN对QN的高度"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7d5491163bce09287597885227d205e6f77aa43f335bcda3cea0b7cac4c344e","citations":["euclid-12-11","euclid-12-13","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the base ABCD is to the base EFGH, so is the cylinder AO to the cylinder ES, for they are of the same height; [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)] and, as the height MN is to QN, so is the cylinder EP to the cylinder ES; [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)] therefore, as the cylinder AO is to the cylinder ES, so is the cylinder EP to the cylinder ES. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 ABCD与底边 EFGH的比等于AO气瓶与ES气瓶的比,因为它们的高度相同;而MN与QN的高度比等于EP气瓶与ES气瓶的比;因此,AO气瓶与ES气瓶的比等于EP气瓶与ES气瓶的比 [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)] [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc6da01c6deb6f77eec1d4419b4c3b03d4463108836145e426f9ecb98be9aa76","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the cylinder AO is equal to the cylinder EP. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AO气瓶等于EP气瓶。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bea08859a83901aa917b495b0715b626d80a3161e66da6d7b550a6dfe678ca36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the same is true for the cones also. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"锥形也是一样 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-15.source","contentId":"euclid-12-15","revisionId":"euclid-12-15@raw-9cb7a8da67bb0c67","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4224cbc6a4821a8c91a04b57b333ee5ea49a19d7a3f8c036d59c0ce829a558fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.5","euclid-12-15.proof.9","euclid-12-15.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XII. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"V. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.9","euclid-12-15.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XII. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.10","euclid-12-15.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.16"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"V. 9"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-11:explicit","id":"euclid-12-11","book":12,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与圆锥","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-7:explicit","id":"euclid-5-7","book":5,"number":7,"kind":"proposition","title":"相等的量与同一量形成相同的比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-13:explicit","id":"euclid-12-13","book":12,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与平面与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-11:explicit","id":"euclid-5-11","book":5,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例相等的传递性","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-5-9:explicit","id":"euclid-5-9","book":5,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
